static const char __pyx_k_Cython_UI_helpers_extracted_from[] = "Cython UI helpers extracted from `sao_gui.py`.\n\nThese are pure-logic / pure-arithmetic hot paths that the recognition loop\nand panel-float scheduler hit at 30-60 Hz. They have no Tk/PIL dependency,\nso moving them out of Python avoids per-call attribute lookups, exception\nmachinery, and `int(...)` boxing.\n\nFunctions:\n    pick_burst_trigger_slot \342\200\224 9-slot burst-anchor state machine\n    panel_float_offsets \342\200\224 sinusoidal dx/dy for the panel-float tick\n    format_level_text \342\200\224 Lv display ('33' or '33(+5)')\n    normalize_watched_skill_slots \342\200\224 dedupe/clip skill slot list\n    is_dead_state \342\200\224 gs HP-based death predicate\n    boss_monster_usable \342\200\224 boss-bar candidate predicate\n    format_session_power \342\200\224 '12,345' or '--'\n    session_int \342\200\224 defensive int parse\n";
